# =============================================================================
# Unreal Engine
# =============================================================================
#
# Everything below is either regenerated by the engine or rebuilt from source.
# Committing it would push ~2.7 GB of derived data that no clone needs.

# Compiled module DLLs and the editor binaries (~125 MB here).
Binaries/
Plugins/*/Binaries/

# Build intermediates: .obj, generated UHT headers, .pch (~2.6 GB here).
Intermediate/
Plugins/*/Intermediate/
Build/
Plugins/*/Build/

# Shader and asset caches. Machine-local, regenerated on demand.
DerivedDataCache/

# Logs, crash dumps, autosaves, automation reports, per-user editor layout.
Saved/

# =============================================================================
# IDE
# =============================================================================

.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace

# =============================================================================
# Audio assets
# =============================================================================
#
# The footstep, landing and wind sounds used during development are Valve's and
# are deliberately NOT redistributed. The audio system degrades to silence when
# they are absent and logs what is missing on the first step that would have
# played -- see the Audio section of the README for how to supply your own.

Content/sounds/
Content/sounds/player/

# =============================================================================
# Unreal template content
# =============================================================================
#
# Shipped with the Third Person / Shooter template and unused by this project:
# ASourcePlayerPawn has no mesh at all, only a scene root, the hull proxy and a
# camera. Characters/ alone is 19 MB, 17 of which is one Control Rig asset.
#
# Config/DefaultEngine.ini must not point EditorStartupMap or GameDefaultMap at
# anything under these paths, or a fresh clone opens to a missing map. Both now
# default to /Engine/Maps/Entry.Entry.

Content/Characters/
Content/Variant_Shooter/

# Imported maps. Workshop geometry belongs to its authors and to Valve, and is not
# redistributed here; see the "Importing CS2 maps" section of the README for the pipeline that
# produces it. Also keeps ~250 MB of .uasset out of the history.
Content/maps/

# One File Per Actor puts a level's actors outside its .umap, so ignoring a map is
# not enough -- these have to go too, or the repo carries actors with no level to
# belong to and the editor complains about every one of them on load.
Content/__ExternalActors__/
Content/__ExternalObjects__/

# The template GAME MODULE (Horror / Shooter / AI / weapons). Nothing in the
# movement port references it, and it is no longer part of the project:
# UCSourceCharacter.uproject and both Target.cs files name SourceMovement only,
# which is the single module needed to build. Leaving the directory on disk is
# harmless -- UnrealBuildTool never looks at a module the project does not list.
Source/UCSourceCharacter/

# Grid meshes and materials for blockout geometry. NOT ignored on purpose: these
# are what a test level gets built out of, and they are Epic's, so redistributing
# them is fine.
# Content/LevelPrototyping/

# =============================================================================
# Console configs
# =============================================================================
#
# The PRESETS are part of the project and must be committed:
#   cfg/surf.cfg  cfg/bhop.cfg  cfg/kz.cfg  cfg/csgo.cfg
#
# These two are not. config.cfg is regenerated by host_writeconfig and on
# shutdown; autoexec.cfg belongs to whoever cloned the repo and is seeded from a
# template on first run. Committing either would overwrite a user's own binds.

cfg/config.cfg
cfg/autoexec.cfg

# =============================================================================
# OS
# =============================================================================

Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
